      "text": [
        "4542 - وَ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ:\n\"إِنَّ اَلْجَنَّةَ لَتُوجَدُ رِيحُهَا مِنْ مَسِيرَةِ خَمْسِمِائَةِ عَامٍ وَ لاَ يَجِدُهَا عَاقٌّ وَ لاَ دَيُّوثٌ\" قِيلَ يَا رَسُولَ اَللَّهِ وَ مَا اَلدَّيُّوثُ قَالَ \"اَلَّذِي تَزْنِي اِمْرَأَتُهُ وَ هُوَ يَعْلَمُ بِهَا\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4542 - He (sw) said:\n\"Indeed, the fragrance of Paradise can be perceived from a distance of five hundred years, but one who is disobedient to his parents and a cuckold (dayyuth) will not perceive it.\"\nIt was asked: \"O Messenger of Allah (swt), who is the dayyuth?\"\nHe (peace and blessings be upon him and his family) said: \"The one whose wife commits adultery, and he is aware of it.\""
        ]
      }
    },
